@startuml
title C16 package resolution and production build
' Traces: OMCT-C16-L2-01.03, OMCT-C16-L2-01.04, OMCT-C16-L2-02.01
actor "Package consumer" as Consumer
participant "Package metadata" as PackageMetadata
participant "Build script" as BuildScript
participant "Webpack production config" as Webpack
participant "TypeScript compiler" as Tsc
participant "dist package" as Dist

Consumer -> PackageMetadata: resolve package entry points
activate PackageMetadata
PackageMetadata --> Consumer: import, require, module, main, and type paths
deactivate PackageMetadata

BuildScript -> Webpack: run production webpack build
activate Webpack
Webpack -> Dist: emit UMD bundle, workers, theme CSS, favicons, index page, imagery assets
activate Dist
Dist --> Webpack: assets emitted
deactivate Dist
Webpack --> BuildScript: webpack build complete
deactivate Webpack
BuildScript -> Tsc: compile type declarations
activate Tsc
Tsc -> Dist: emit dist/types/index.d.ts
activate Dist
Dist --> Tsc: declarations emitted
deactivate Dist
Tsc --> BuildScript: TypeScript build complete
deactivate Tsc
BuildScript --> Consumer: built package artifacts available
@enduml
